<div class="container article-page"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href="<?php echo $base_url; ?>"><i class="fas fa-home"></i> Trang chủ</a><i class="fas fa-chevron-right"></i><a href="<?php echo $base_url; ?>tin-tuc">Tin tức</a><i class="fas fa-chevron-right"></i><span><?php echo htmlspecialchars($n['title']); ?></span></div><div class="article-shell"><article class="article-main"><div class="article-cover"><?php if($n['thumbnail']):?><img src="<?php echo htmlspecialchars(media_url($n['thumbnail'],$base_url)); ?>" alt="<?php echo htmlspecialchars($n['title']); ?>"><?php else:?><div class="cover-fallback"><i class="fas fa-newspaper"></i></div><?php endif;?></div><header class="article-header"><time><?php echo date('d/m/Y H:i',strtotime($n['created_at'])); ?></time><h1><?php echo htmlspecialchars($n['title']); ?></h1><p class="article-lead"><?php echo htmlspecialchars(mb_substr(strip_tags($n['content']),0,180)); ?>...</p></header><div class="article-content"><?php echo normalize_content_media_urls($n['content'], $base_url); ?></div></article><aside class="article-side"><h2 class="side-title">Bài viết liên quan</h2><div class="related-list"><?php while($r=$related->fetch_assoc()):?><a class="related-item" href="<?php echo $base_url.'tin-tuc/'.createSlug($r['title']).'-'.$r['id']; ?>"><?php if($r['thumbnail']):?><img src="<?php echo htmlspecialchars(media_url($r['thumbnail'],$base_url)); ?>" alt="<?php echo htmlspecialchars($r['title']); ?>"><?php else:?><div class="related-fallback"><i class="fas fa-file-lines"></i></div><?php endif;?><h3><?php echo htmlspecialchars($r['title']); ?></h3></a><?php endwhile;?></div><div class="ai-box"><i class="fas fa-robot"></i><strong>Cần hỏi thêm?</strong><p>Chatbot có thể giải thích cấu hình, hiệu năng, khả năng tương thích và gợi ý thiết bị phù hợp với nhu cầu sử dụng.</p><button type="button" class="js-open-ai">Hỏi AI</button></div></aside></div></div><?php require_once 'footer.php'; ?>
